================================================================================
STATUS — PENDING OWNER CONFIRMATION
================================================================================

This file is a DRAFT. It has not been formally adopted by the copyright holder.

Why it exists: the repository previously carried no `LICENSE` file and no
`license` field in `package.json`. `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` described the source
code only as "MIT-shaped original work" — a description, not a grant.

What the copyright holder must decide before treating this as final:

  1. Confirm MIT as the intended licence for the source code, and fill in the
     real copyright holder name above (individual legal name or entity).
  2. Confirm that the scope is code only. The ART IS NOT COVERED by this MIT
     grant. `public/assets/artpack/`, `public/assets/ui/frame-*.png`,
     `public/assets/ui/slot.png`, `public/assets/env/`, `public/assets/title/`
     and `public/assets/weapons/` are owner-supplied artwork whose terms the
     owner has not yet stated. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
  3. Confirm that third-party components keep their own licences: Phaser (MIT),
     Ark Pixel Font (SIL OFL 1.1), Kenney selection marker (CC0 1.0), pixelfx
     effect sheets (MIT). Those are enumerated in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and are
     not relicensed by this file.

Until the holder confirms, treat this file as a proposal. If a different licence
is chosen, replace the text above wholesale rather than appending to it — a
LICENSE file with two licences in it grants nothing clearly.